{"title": "Sanguine Vent", "pageid": 47958, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sanguine_Vent", "categories": ["Environmental objects", "Traps"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SanguineVent.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/SanguineVent.png/250px-SanguineVent.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/SanguineVent.png/375px-SanguineVent.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f6/SanguineVent.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/SanguineVent.png/250px-SanguineVent.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/SanguineVent.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>A triggered vent surrounded with Unstable Blood</figcaption></figure>\n<p>A <b>Sanguine Vent</b> is a unique type of <a href=\"/wiki/Trap\" title=\"Trap\">Trap</a> that might be encountered in the <a href=\"/wiki/Undercity_Ruins\" title=\"Undercity Ruins\">Undercity Ruins</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a> of the game.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>A Sanguine Vent is a hidden mechanism, a unique type of <a href=\"/wiki/Vent\" title=\"Vent\">Vent</a>, installed in the stone slabs of the floor in the caves in the very depth of the ruins. There are several such vents planted in the pavement of the large bridge leading to the <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal_Temple\" title=\"Bhaal Temple\">Bhaal Temple</a>. These vents will be inevitably encountered when the player reaches the climax of their conflict with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/25px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/38px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/50px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Orin the Red\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/25px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin the Red</a>.\n</p><p>Once triggered, a Sanguine Vent issues a puddle of <a href=\"/wiki/Unstable_Blood_(surface)\" title=\"Unstable Blood (surface)\">Unstable Blood</a> covering much part of the surface around it. This may be either a result of failed attempt to disarm it or a result of stepping upon any of <a href=\"/wiki/Marble_Plate\" title=\"Marble Plate\">Marble Plates</a> also lying across the bridge.\nAfter that, if the party members tread carefully, they will not gain any harm save for blood-soaked shoe soles.\n</p><p>However, the resulting bloodied surface has all properties of the cognominal <a href=\"/wiki/Unstable_Blood\" title=\"Unstable Blood\">feature</a> (the very same that can possibly be acquired after dealing with the blood trader <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/25px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/38px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/50px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Araj Oblodra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/25px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\">Araj Oblodra</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a>). On the contact with a source of fire, whatever it would be, the bloodied surface explodes and keep burning for three turns.\n</p><p>This effect might be reached easily, as the bridge on which the Sanguine Vents are hidden, is lit by several braziers, already burning, and also several candles.\n</p><p>A Sanguine Vent can be spotted with a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;15 Perception Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;15 <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> check and disarmed with the help of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/25px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/38px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/50px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sleight of Hand\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/25px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">Sleight of Hand</a> skill, but the interacting party member must have a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit\" title=\"Trap Disarm Toolkit\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit\" title=\"Trap Disarm Toolkit\">Trap Disarm Toolkit</a> in their inventory. Difficulty Class requirement is a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;10 Sleight of Hand Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;10 <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">Sleight of Hand</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> roll.\n</p><p>After disarming, a Sanguine Vent is depicted as the same, but rendered inactive further on. As with other types of \"spilling\" vents, the puddle of blood around the aperture itself partly disappears.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202656\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1389/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 10211/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2028/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 898218/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.045      1 -total\n 57.08%   16.580      5 Template:Icon_text\n 51.56%   14.977     18 Template:Trim\n 48.33%   14.038      2 Template:CharLink\n 43.83%   12.731      3 Template:Icon_link\n 32.69%    9.496      7 Template:Ifempty\n 28.23%    8.198      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n 22.04%    6.402      1 Template:Item_icon\n 16.68%    4.845      2 Template:Ability_check\n 10.89%    3.162      7 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:47958-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202656 and revision id 285618. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}